  "notes": "Blackpine's hub. Hill and adit north with tram rails to the ore bin, the pine line and woods trail west, the Blackwater and the broken trestle south, the log pond and flume east. The yard holds the shift bell, the pump and teaching clue, the notice board, the kit chest, four lantern posts and the ten yard spawns. Bunkhouse (Child-only porch crawlspace), sawmill, Company Office [M], Forge [M], woodshed, log deck and the chute landing. Round 8 (8K): the window lights sit in their walls and the forge glow in the smithy door; a bench and a barrel on the bunkhouse porch, firewood and a chopping block by the woodshed, a grindstone, crates and a barrel by the forge, an ore cart, a wheelbarrow, a timber set and an ore pile at the adit, crates by the office, logs, a saw horse, crates and a wheelbarrow in the mill yard, a signpost at the woods trail and a bucket by the pump.",
